                    <msContents>
                        <summary/>           
                        <msItem xml:id="ms_i1">
                            <locus from="5ra" to="152va"/>
                            <title ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT2001Mazmur">Mazmura fǝśśuḥān wa-ṣalota tǝkkuzān</title>
                            <note>The salām-hymns normally begin with the 1st Maskaram, whereas this one begins with the 12th Hedār covering 12 months
                                of the calendar.</note>
                            <textLang mainLang="gez"/>
                            <msItem xml:id="ms_i1.1">
                                <locus from="5ra" to="5rb"/>
                                <title type="incomplete">Preamble</title>
                                <incipit xml:lang="gez">ኅዳር። ማኅበረ፡ መላእክት፡ ወሰብእ፡ ተዓይነ፡ ክርስቶስ፡ ወእሙ። ሰላም፡ ለክሙ። ሶበ፡ እከሥት፡ አፉየ፡ ለውዳሴክሙ። ፍሬ፡
                                    ማኅሌት፡ እምልሳንየ፡ ትቅስሙ። ምስሌየ፡ ሀልው፡ ወምስሌየ፡ ቁሙ። ሰላም፡ ለአብ፡ ወለወልድ፡ ቃሉ። ወለመንፈስ፡ ቅዱስ፡ ዋሕድ፡ ዘአካሎሙ፡ አካሉ። ሰላም፡
                                    ለማርያም፡ እንተ፡ ተሳተፈት፡ ስብሐተ፡ እሉ፤ ሰላም፡ ለመላእክት፡ ወለ<cb n="5rb"/>ማኅበረ፡ በኵር፡ ኵሉ፡ ጽሑፋነ፡ መልክዕ፡ ወስም፡ በሰማይ፡ ዘላዕሉ።
                                        </incipit> 
                            </msItem>
                            <msItem xml:id="ms_i1.2">
                                <locus from="5rb"/>
                                <title type="incomplete">Salām-hymns for Ḫǝdār</title>
                                <note>Beginning with a salām-hymn to <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS7049Michael">St. Michael</persName> and a salām-hymn
                                    to Philotheus, the 63rd patriarch of Alexandria for 12 Ḫǝdār.</note>
                                <incipit xml:lang="gez"><abbr><ex>ሰ</ex><expan>ላም</expan></abbr>፡ እብል፡ ኪያከ፡ መልአከ፡ ርኅሩሐ፡ ልብ፡ ለኵሉ፡ እንተ፡
                                    ኢኮንከ፡ ድሩከ። ሚካኤል፡ <gap reason="ellipsis"/> <abbr><ex>ሰ</ex><expan>ላም፡</expan></abbr> ለአስተርእዮትከ፡
                                    ውስተ፡ ደብረ፡ ማህው፡ ዮም። አምሳለ፡ ቅብአ፡ ዘይት፡ ጥዑም።</incipit> 
                            </msItem>
