                                    <desc type="GuestText">A passage of about ten lines of a salām-hymn addressed to 
                                        <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS8974Stephen">ʾEsṭifānos</persName>, written in an untrained hand.</desc>
                                </item>
